OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court on murder charge
OL,4,Aafter woman's body found in burning van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 38-year-old man has been remanded in
OL,7,Fcustody accused of murdering a woman in
OL,8,FPrestatyn.
OL,10,FThe body of the victim, who is yet to
OL,11,Fbe formally identified, was discovered
OL,12,Fin a burning van in the Denbighshire
OL,13,Ftown on Sunday evening.
OL,15,FThomas Bell, from Wellington Road in
OL,16,FRhyl, appeared via a video link and
OL,17,Fspoke only to confirm his name in the
OL,18,Fshort hearing at Mold Crown Court.
OL,20,FHe was arrested on Monday after a
OL,21,Fmurder investigation was launched.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
